<p>Hi, I&apos;m John — a software engineer, graduate student, machine learning enthusiast, and most importantly, a husband and father of three. I love building things, whether it’s software, hardware, or even just a good meal. 
   I&apos;m passionate about learning and sharing knowledge, which is why I started this blog. 
   Here, I write about my experiences in software development, machine learning, and the occasional personal project.
